    "name": "Cherry Hotel and Apartment",
    "detail": "This hotel was so good. The rooms were lovely and the bed was so comfy, the rooms had a lovley table and sofa with a mini kitchen. The pool was quite big and nice, the gym looked food although we didn't use it. This hotel frot he money you pay is just amazing. The location we found wasn't that good, although we didn't really look around because we were so tired from flying. It did look like across the road there was a street with bars for food and drink. We did also find a place to eat which was so cheap so it was okay for us as we were only there for the one night. But I 100% recommend if you are wanting to be close to the airport or want to have a quick drive after a long flight for somewhere to stay. Amazing hotel. Staff were so friendly and helped us in every way they could. Even let us check in at 12 and use the pool while waiting. ",
